@startuml
title SQ01 — Asisten AI dengan Riwayat Sesi Server
actor Pelapor
boundary "UI Lapor" as UI
control AiAssistantController as AIC
control GeminiAssistant as GA
database "Sesi server" as Session
participant "Google Gemini" as Gemini
Pelapor -> UI : Tulis pertanyaan/detail kejadian
UI -> AIC : POST /lapor/asisten-ai\nmessage saja (maks. 600 karakter)
AIC -> AIC : Validasi, throttle, session lock\nTolak history/model/tools dari browser
AIC -> Session : Ambil maks. 8 pesan (<30 menit tidak aktif)
AIC -> GA : ask(redactedMessage, serverHistory)
GA -> Gemini : generateContent (konfigurasi server)
alt sukses
  Gemini --> GA : Jawaban Bahasa Indonesia
  GA --> AIC : Teks jawaban
  AIC -> Session : Simpan maks. 8 pesan + waktu
  AIC --> UI : 200 answer, private/no-store
else provider gagal atau AI nonaktif
  AIC --> UI : 503 pesan aman
end
@enduml

@startuml
title SQ02 — OTP, Laporan, Penugasan, dan Penyelesaian
actor Pelapor
control PelaporController as PC
control OtpService as OTP
participant "WhatsAppService / bot lokal" as WA
database "Database / cache / sesi" as DB
actor "Super Admin" as SA
control ReportAssignmentController as RAC
actor "Admin penanggung jawab" as Admin
control ReportStatusController as RSC
control CompleteReportController as CRC
participant "API e-Profil" as EP
Pelapor -> PC : POST /lapor/otp (telepon)
PC -> OTP : issue + send
OTP -> DB : Cache OTP 5 menit, jeda 60 detik
OTP -> WA : Kirim OTP
Pelapor -> PC : POST /lapor/otp/verify
PC -> OTP : verify
OTP -> DB : Verifikasi sesi 15 menit
Pelapor -> PC : POST /lapor\ntelepon, deskripsi, lokasi, foto?, persetujuan
PC -> PC : Validasi verifikasi sesi
PC -> DB : Transaksi GuestAccess + Report submitted\nHistory + Attachment, belum ditugaskan
PC -> DB : Notifikasi Admin/Super Admin aktif
PC -> WA : Konfirmasi pelapor + Admin aktif dengan nomor
PC --> Pelapor : Kode laporan + cookie token
SA -> RAC : PATCH assignment pada tahun terpilih
RAC -> DB : Validasi Admin aktif, lock Report\nassigned_admin_id + audit
Admin -> RSC : Proses satu tahap (tahun sesuai)
RSC -> DB : Gate + lock + status awal\nsubmitted → received → verifying
alt ditolak dari verifying
  RSC -> DB : rejected + alasan + riwayat/audit
  RSC -> WA : Status ditolak + alasan
else dilanjutkan
  RSC -> DB : in_progress + riwayat/audit
  RSC -> WA : Pembaruan status
  Admin -> CRC : Hasil, tanggal, lokasi, NIP, foto
  CRC -> EP : Ambil NIP valid
  CRC -> DB : Gate + lock + cek status/duplikasi\nActivity external + activity_personnel\nTemuan? + foto + completed + audit
  CRC -> WA : Hasil selesai + tautan SKM
  Pelapor -> PC : Status dengan token + feedback sekali
  PC -> DB : Verifikasi kepemilikan/completed, simpan rating
end
note over WA,DB
Notifikasi non-OTP dicoba setelah data tersimpan.
Kegagalan kirim tidak membatalkan transaksi.
end note
@enduml

@startuml
title SQ03 — Tahun Data, Dashboard, dan Ekspor
actor "Pengguna internal" as User
control DataYearController as DYC
database "Sesi tahun / database" as DB
control "SuperAdminController / AdminController" as C
boundary "Dashboard / daftar kegiatan" as UI
User -> DYC : PUT /data-year (tahun tersedia)
DYC -> DB : Simpan data_year dalam sesi
DYC --> User : Redirect dashboard sesuai role
User -> C : Buka dashboard/kegiatan
C -> DB : Query tahun created_at / activity_date\nFilter daftar dan dataset ekspor seluruh halaman
C --> UI : Statistik, peta / kegiatan + dataset ekspor
User -> UI : Ekspor Excel / PDF / Word
UI -> C : Ambil foto lewat route autentikasi dan tahun
C --> UI : Foto kegiatan + bukti publik laporan terkait
UI --> User : Berkas xlsx / pdf / docx
@enduml
